  }))), "Level 2: DSL Generation"), mdx("p", null, "To solve the unpredictability and quality issues of Level 1, we can take a more abstract approach. Instead of asking the AI to generate code directly, we ask it to generate an intermediate, agreed-upon language that describes the UI\u2014a Domain-Specific Language (DSL)."), mdx("p", null, "For example, if a user requests, \"Show me a list of this month's new sign-ups in a table,\" the LLM generates a JSON-based DSL like the following, instead of code:"), mdx("deckgo-highlight-code", {
